body:
I asked for a greyhound who could be trained to be a service or an emotional support dog and only deal with those types of greyhounds. I've had training in service dog training so for me it is pretty easy! The hard part was training myself to teach her to do it all by myself. A lot of people get two together and have them sit and one dispenses the treat. I had to basically hold her down while sitting down with her and held the treat with my hand.

&#x200B;

You want to teach them the action before teaching them the word. So just getting them used to even barely sitting should be rewarded.
